MSG_WelcomeTitle
Ongi etorri AROS QuickPart-era!
; Welcome to AROS QuickPart!
;
MSG_WelcomeText
Programa honek zure disko gogorra prestatzeko\naukera emango dizu, AROSek erabili ahal izan dezan.\n\nOker erabiliz gero, sistema abiaraztezin\ngera daiteke, edo berriro instalatzea\nbehar izan daiteke - kontuz ibili!
; This program will allow you to prepare your\nhard disk so that it may be used by AROS.\n\nIncorrect usage may cause your system\nto become unbootable, or even require\nre-installation - please be carefull!
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION
Partizionatu unitateak AROS instalatzeko prestatzeko.
; Partition Drives in preperation of installing AROS.
;
MSG_SCALE_DRIVES
E_skalatu unitateak
; _Scale Drives
;
MSG_BUBBLEHELP
Gaitu/Desgaitu burbuila-laguntza
; Enable/Disable bubble help
;
MSG_SEARCHING
Disko gogorrak bilatzen....\n
; Looking for Hard Disks....\n
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION_LEGEND
Zerrendatu QuickPart-en partizioak irudikatzeko erabilitako koloreak
; List the colors used to represent Partitions in QuickPart
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION_CREATE
Sortu partizio bat 'HAUTATUTAKO' erabili gabeko espazioan
; Create a partition in the 'SELECTED' unused space
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION_DELETE
Ezabatu 'HAUTATUTAKO' partizio bat
; Delete a 'SELECTED' Existing partition
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION_DISK
Hau zure ordenagailuan aurkitutako disko gogor bat da
; This is a Harddisk found in your computer
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION_DISKNAME
Hau zure disko gogorraren mota edo izena da\n\nPartizio-taula egitura ezagunen bat aurkitzen bada\n izenaren ondoren parentesi artean erakusten da
; This is the type or name of your harddisk\n\nIf there is a know partition table structure found\n it is displayed in brackets after the name
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION_DISKSIZE
Hau disko gogorraren tamaina da
; This is the size of the Harddisk
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION_DISKDEVICE
Hau zure disko gogorra konektatuta dagoen gailua da
; This is the device your Harddisk is connected to
;
MSG_DESCRIPTION_PARTITIONS
Barrak zure disko gogorraren edukia irudikatzen du\n\nErabilgarria izan aurretik, AROSerako partizio egokiak egon behar dira
; The bar represents the content of your harddisk\n\nBefore it is usable, suitable partitons for AROS must be present
;
MSG_GUIFAILED
Zune GUIa hasieratzeak huts egin du\n
; Failed to intialize Zune GUI\n
